{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:44:55.396625", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network is a 4-tier data center Clos topology using EBGP for routing. It includes DNS servers, web servers, and external client hosts. The reachability test results indicate that there are issues with communication between hosts in the network.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Reachability Test Results**:\\n   - **Client to Web Server**:\\n     - Source: `client_0` (192.168.0.2)\\n     - Destination: `webserver0_pod0` (10.0.1.2)\\n     - Status: `unknown` (No data on transmitted or received packets, loss percentage, or RTT metrics)\\n   - **DNS Server to Web Server**:\\n     - Source: `dns_pod0` (10.0.0.2)\\n     - Destination: `webserver0_pod0` (10.0.1.2)\\n     - Status: `unknown`\\n   - **DNS Server to Client**:\\n     - Source: `dns_pod0` (10.0.0.2)\\n     - Destination: `client_0` (192.168.0.2)\\n     - Status: `unknown`\\n   - **Web Server to Client**:\\n     - Source: `webserver0_pod0` (10.0.1.2)\\n     - Destination: `client_0` (192.168.0.2)\\n     - Status: `unknown`\\n\\n2. **Anomalies Detected**:\\n   - All reachability tests returned a status of `unknown`, indicating that no communication is occurring between the hosts.\\n   - There is no data on packet transmission, reception, or round-trip times, which suggests potential issues with routing, connectivity, or host configurations.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to identify the root cause of the communication failure. This may involve:\\n- Verifying the network configurations of individual hosts and routers.\\n- Checking BGP configurations and routing tables on the routers.\\n- Inspecting the DNS server and web server configurations.\\n- Testing connectivity at the interface level.\\n\\nThis report highlights the current state of the network and the anomalies observed. Further analysis will focus on pinpointing the faulty devices and identifying the root cause of the issue., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='64ed4ea6-0a5b-46df-892a-342fcc4941af'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
